WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.833
Step 1: Open Settings → Award compliance. Overview shows Employer, Employees and Public holidays for each accessible trading location.

2
00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:18.042
Step 2: Choose Open setup for the location. Enter the legal employer and pay period, confirm award coverage and turn on automatic award wages, then Save settings. Optional employer cost estimates are expandable.

3
00:00:18.042 --> 00:00:37.375
Step 3: Expand Employee details → Edit details. Choose employment type, classification and allowances; Pay Rates underneath updates without saving. Add regular working hours is optional during setup; complete part-time costs need written hours or a current signed IFA permitting roster-based hours. Press Save employment details and check Roster setup ready. The location state supplies automatic roster holiday estimates.

4
00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:49.208
Step 4: Before approving actual pay, choose Review dates. Check the full year’s holidays, including local, substitute and part-day periods; expand All day to edit times when needed. Confirm the review and Save location calendar.

5
00:00:49.208 --> 00:01:08.208
Step 5: Open the small red award error icon on roster staff rows or shift cards to read current checks. Allowances are selected during staff setup and Pay Conditions. In Timesheets, use Pay details for actual allowance quantities, breaks or written variations. Missing wage inputs must be completed. Advanced rules and source details remain available for reviewed updates.
